  "slug": "easy-corn-chowder-i",
  "name": "Easy Corn Chowder",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This creamy chowder is a simple soup with simple ingredients that will win you over. Serve with corn bread and a crisp salad for an elegant dinner or a substantial lunch!",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Saut\u00e9 bacon and onions together in a large saucepan over medium heat until onions are tender, about 7 minutes. Add corn, potatoes, soup, milk, salt, and pepper. Increase heat to high and bring to a boil. Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer until potatoes are tender, about 25 to 35 minutes, stirring occasionally."
    }
  ],
